  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning of Programme &quot;Forests, Communities and Sustainable Growth&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project covers the MEL activities currently contracted with Tetra Tech to conduct Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning activities until the TEFOS programme is finished. It basically includes the elaboration of Annual Reports, the conduction of specific case studies and the assessment of the log frame targets and Theory of Change consistency.</narrative>
  </description>
